  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommonly appears in compound forms and product marketing. {安眠|あんみん}{妨害|ぼうがい} (sleep disturbance) is a common complaint in neighborhood disputes. {安眠|あんみん}グッズ (sleep aids/products) is frequently seen in stores.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {安眠|あんみん}を{妨|さまた}げる: to disturb one's sleep\n- {安眠|あんみん}{妨害|ぼうがい}: sleep disturbance\n- {安眠|あんみん}{効果|こうか}: sleep-promoting effect\n- {安眠|あんみん}グッズ: sleep-aid products\n- {安眠|あんみん}{枕|まくら}: sleep pillow",
